+// Chrome's extension surfaces an embedder draws in its own UI for a page it
+// presents: the toolbar button's own menu items (contextMenus of context
+// "action"), the omnibox keyword's events and suggestions, and the side
+// panel's options as the extension changes them. Chrome keeps every rule;
+// the client only draws and forwards what a person did.
